Weapon scripts outside the milestone set (TestData/weapons holds exactly the
milestone's 32, which the weapon-table facts enumerate): read only by the facts
that name them, through WeaponFixtures.WithExtras.

tf_weapon_handgun_scout_secondary: the scout's back_headshot pistol class, for
TFDamageLayerTests' hit-location fact (CTFPistol_ScoutSecondary::GetDamageType).
Extracted and trimmed exactly as TestData/weapons/README describes.

tf_weapon_flaregun: the pyro's secondary, for the flare facts' kind, fire and
damage rows (TFWeaponKinds.Of's Projectile case, the tf_projectile_flare entity).
Extracted and trimmed exactly as TestData/weapons/README describes.

tf_weapon_robot_arm: the Gunslinger's own row (items_working.tsv:58), the melee
the kit stands the engineer's unlock wrench on (TFWeaponTypes' WrenchArm seed).
tf_weapon_lunchbox: the heavy's sandvich, for the lunchbox behaviour's facts
(TFLunchboxBehaviour's eat and throw over TFLunchboxTests' world).
tf_weapon_jar, tf_weapon_jar_milk: the sniper's and the scout's jars, for the
jar facts' kind, meter and launch rows (TFWeaponKinds.Of's Projectile case, the
tf_projectile_jar entity, the effect-bar purse).
Extracted and trimmed exactly as TestData/weapons/README describes.

tf_weapon_crossbow: the medic's Crusader's Crossbow, for the healing bolt's kind
and reload rows (TFWeaponKinds.Of's Projectile case, tf_projectile_healing_bolt).
Extracted and trimmed exactly as TestData/weapons/README describes.

tf_weapon_laser_pointer: the Wrangler, for the row, kind and behaviour facts
(TFWeaponKinds.Of's LaserPointer case, TFWranglerBehaviour's vetoed triggers).
Extracted and trimmed exactly as TestData/weapons/README describes.

tf_weapon_katana: the Half-Zatoichi (items_working.tsv:357), the demoman's and
soldier's honourbound duel melee (CTFKatana, tf_weapon_sword.h). Extracted and
trimmed exactly as TestData/weapons/README describes.

tf_weapon_raygun, tf_weapon_drg_pomson, tf_weapon_particle_cannon: the energy
family — the bison's and the pomson's rings, the Cow Mangler's charged ball —
for the energy behaviour's facts (TFWeaponKind's Energy case, the ring and ball
entities, the tank that spends and refills in whole shots).

tf_weapon_rocketlauncher_airstrike: the soldier's Air Strike, for the airstrike
facts' kind, press and kill rows (TFWeaponKinds.Of's Projectile case, the
blast-jump fire-rate and the clip grown on a kill).
Extracted and trimmed exactly as TestData/weapons/README describes.
tf_weapon_flaregun_revenge: the Manmelter, for the vacuum's behaviour and
effects facts (TFWeaponKinds.Of's FlaregunRevenge id, the press and the frame
tail over TFFlareGun_Revenge). Extracted and trimmed exactly as
TestData/weapons/README describes.
