tf_weapon_cannon: the demoman's Loose Cannon, a stand-in copied from the grenade
launcher's fixture for the table's kind and catalogue facts; the shipped script
deploys and fires in a live boot (items_working.tsv row 996).
tf_weapon_soda_popper, tf_weapon_pep_brawler_blaster: the scout's hype pair
(items_working.tsv:151, :199), the two scattergun skins of CTFScatterGun
(TFWeaponKinds.Of's Shotgun case, the Soda Popper's drink and the hype speed).
Extracted and trimmed exactly as TestData/weapons/README describes.

tf_weapon_bat_giftwrap: the Wrap Assassin (items_working.tsv:648), the scout bat
whose alt-fire is the ornament ball (CTFBat_Giftwrap over CTFBat_Wood,
tf_weapon_bat.cpp) — the primary_ammo TF_AMMO_GRENADES1 row the effect bar
purse stands for. Extracted and trimmed exactly as TestData/weapons/README
describes.
tf_weapon_rocketpack: the Thermal Thruster (items_working.tsv:329), the
pyro's thruster secondary, for the landing-push facts (TFDamageLayer's fall
